  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mid-Term Review of Global Partnership for Education (GPE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the MTR is to assess the continued relevance of the Danish support to and partnership with GPE, including how GPE results provide synergies towards achieving Denmark&#x2019;s priorities and ways of engaging with GPE. Furthermore, it should assess synergies with other Danish instruments as well as the coordination with other development partners. The MTR will complement the MOPAN assessment and other donors&#x2019; reviews and evaluations of GPE. The findings of the review should also inform the considerations and preparations for a new organisation strategy for Denmark&#x2019;s engagement with GPE, including through a draft outline of this.</narrative>
  </description>
